# CVF-23: Cargo.lock IS committed for this crate. It was previously
# gitignored, which meant the KAT / cross-lang parity results and the
# fuzz-attestation "10^6 corpus entries" figure could not be tied to any
# pinned build. The lock is now tracked so a reader can reconstruct the
# exact dependency graph attested to.
